# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — SMART COLLEGE RESULT & AI REPORT CARD PORTAL

You are a senior full-stack software engineering team consisting of a UI/UX designer, frontend engineer, backend engineer, database architect, security engineer and QA engineer.

Your task is to DESIGN, DEVELOP AND IMPLEMENT a complete, functional, responsive web application named:

**CAMPUSCORE — Smart College Result & AI Report Card Portal**

This is a real college result management system, not a static website, landing-page mockup or frontend-only demonstration.

Build the entire application in one implementation. Do not stop after creating the homepage. Every dashboard, navigation item, form, button, modal, table, workflow and feature must be implemented and connected to working application logic.

Do not leave TODO comments, placeholder buttons, fake navigation, unfinished pages or non-functional interactions.

