# 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

The application solves the following problems in college result management:

1. College mid-semester results are currently shared through public Excel sheets or WhatsApp groups.
2. Students can see other students' marks, creating unnecessary comparison and privacy problems.
3. Different professors submit marks on different dates, resulting in incomplete and fragmented results.
4. Previous semester results are difficult to maintain and retrieve.
5. There is no centralized system for report cards, performance analysis or historical academic records.

Build a centralized platform with three authenticated user roles:

- HOD / Class Administrator
- Professor / Subject Faculty
- Student

The platform must provide private student records, synchronized result publication, historical academic records, Excel imports, PDF report cards, audit logs and AI-assisted performance insights.

