## F. Verify & Publish Final Result

This is the most important HOD feature.

Implement a proper result publication workflow.

Rules:

1. Every registered subject must have a complete marks submission.
2. Every assigned professor must lock their subject.
3. The HOD must verify the complete result.
4. The HOD can publish the result only when all required subjects are locked.
5. Students must never see partial results.
6. Publication must happen atomically.
7. A published result must have a publication timestamp and version.

If even one subject is pending, display:

"Awaiting all subject submissions."

Disable the publish action.

Once all subjects are locked, show:

"All subjects submitted. Ready for verification."

The HOD can review the combined report before clicking:

"VERIFY & PUBLISH RESULT"

After publication, all eligible students must receive access to their complete report cards simultaneously.

Use database transactions to prevent partial publication.

